                "dc.identifier.repealed" : [ {
                  "value" : "false",
                  "language" : null,
                  "authority" : null,
                  "confidence" : -1,
                  "place" : 0
                } ],
                "dc.identifier.section_id" : [ {
                  "value" : "106197",
                  "language" : null,
                  "authority" : null,
                  "confidence" : -1,
                  "place" : 0
                } ],
                "dc.identifier.section_number" : [ {
                  "value" : "175",
                  "language" : null,
                  "authority" : null,
                  "confidence" : -1,
                  "place" : 0
                } ],
                "dc.identifier.section_page_note" : [ {
                  "value" : "<span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span>This Chapter shall apply to,---<br/><hr style=\"border: none; margin-bottom: 8px; margin-top: 0;\"/> <span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span>(a) pollution damage caused by,---<br/><hr style=\"border: none; margin-bottom: 8px; margin-top: 0;\"/> <span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span>(i) Indian vessel within the jurisdiction of any contracting party to the Civil Liability Convention; and<br/><hr style=\"border: none; margin-bottom: 8px; margin-top: 0;\"/> <span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span>(ii) Indian vessel and any ship while it is at a port or place in India including the coastal waters, extending not more than two hundred nautical miles from the baseline;<br/><hr style=\"border: none; margin-bottom: 8px; margin-top: 0;\"/> <span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span>(b) preventive measures, wherever taken, to prevent or minimise such pollution damage. <br/><hr style=\"border: none; margin-bottom: 8px; margin-top: 0;\"/>",
                  "language" : null,
                  "authority" : null,
                  "confidence" : -1,
                  "place" : 0
                } ],
                "dc.identifier.state_id" : [ {
                  "value" : "1",
                  "language" : null,
                  "authority" : null,
                  "confidence" : -1,
                  "place" : 0
                } ],
